    "video_script": "World Cup semi-final: Croatia's best young defender against a thirty-five-year-old. Lionel Messi had already scored a penalty, and Julián Álvarez had made it two-nil. Then Messi picked up the ball on the right, ran past Gvardiol, checked back, and beat him again on the outside. He cut it back, and Álvarez scored again. Argentina won three-nil and reached the final, and that penalty made Messi Argentina's top World Cup scorer. Was this his greatest assist?",
